  "description": "Han Ye-Rim, a video production major at an arts high school, can hear the inner thoughts of those captured in photos and videos. Ye-Rim, who's reluctant to film anything because of her talent, encounters Cha Jin-Ho, a famous model from the entertainment department. But what? Can you hear their inner thoughts too? A bumbling school romance between the prim Ye-Rim and the affectionate Jin-Ho!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
